      "created_at": "2011-11-07T22:13:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can’t imagine the difference between Skryim and Oblivion will be quite as drastic as the difference between Oblivion and Morrowind, but I do look forward to playing Skyrim whenever the price dips below $30. Renovating your home = very little spending money, sadly.</p>\n<p>I wonder if I can make myself a kickstarter… $5, you can watch grainy cellphone video of me playing Skyrim. $500, you can come to my house and watch me play Skyrim.</p>",
