      "created_at": "2011-11-08T14:49:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heh, I hadn’t even considered the consoles when thinking about ES III and IV. I played both on the PC. However, I probably will be playing Skyrim on a console because I just don’t have the time for the “Why does the game keep crashing at startup?” song and dance that frequently accompanies PC games right now.</p>",
